{"ID":"20240314091837-n5uin6b","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091837-n5uin6b","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091837-n5uin6b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170426-hl73div\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170426-l0lffjy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170426-l0lffjy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:111,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:111\u0026#125;","title":"【薏苡附子败酱散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170426"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170426-hl73div","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170426-hl73div","updated":"20240422170426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肠痈者，少腹肿痞，按之即痛，如淋，小便自调，腹无积聚，身无热，脉数此为腹内有痈脓，薏苡附子败酱散主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170426-ewp5toj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170426-ewp5toj","updated":"20240422170426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"薏苡附子败酱散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170426-ekee6vu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170426-ekee6vu","updated":"20240422170426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"薏苡仁十分、附子二分、败酱五分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170426-suoa6na","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170426-suoa6na","updated":"20240422170426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，杵末，取方寸匕，以水二升，煎减半，顿服。（小便当下）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170426-84xo5bf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170426-84xo5bf","updated":"20240422170426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。紧接着呢，常用的第二个处方来了，“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肠痈者，少腹肿痞，按之即痛，如淋，小便自调，腹无积聚，身无热，脉数此为..."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”。此为肠里面已经化脓了。诸位，这就是讲薏苡附子败酱散呢，不是盲肠破裂了，这个...如果是阑尾呢，破掉了，破裂的时侯，跟胆囊破裂是一样，是当归赤豆散。那这个赤小豆跟当归呢是生用，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生用当归，那赤小豆要去发芽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那如果直接不发芽打粉的话，是治疗这个痔疮出血（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"先血后便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阑尾没有破裂，但是在盲肠阻到怎么处理？就是这个薏苡附子败酱散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那这个薏苡附子败酱散呢？大家看：薏仁，附子，败酱，附子的剂量最少。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170426-77771ti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170426-77771ti","updated":"20240422170426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"薏仁呢，它的目的是什么？是除湿。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170426-i1dsmtm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170426-i1dsmtm","updated":"20240422170426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240411151547-fdaefiv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422170426-jkgbubr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170426-jkgbubr","updated":"20240422170426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果盲肠这一段，堵到一大块，宿便呢，就堵在这一块地方（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如图红圈处"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），这是肠子里面，并没有到外面哦，那我们用这个附子呢，轻剂的，一钱或二钱，都没有关系，很轻的量。炮附子哦，为什么用轻的量？因为炮附子药性比较热。所谓热就是能让它动起来。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"薏仁除湿的力量很强"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为盲肠里面有很多的湿的津液嘛在里面。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"败酱草可以把食物分解掉，腐化掉，让它松动"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以说加上炮附子的热，可以把这个部分的宿食统统带出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170426-rq4i9ma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170426-rq4i9ma","updated":"20240422170426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"慢性盲肠炎讲的就是这个薏苡附子败酱散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真正破裂转成腹膜炎的时候，大黄牡丹皮汤、薏苡附子败酱散都不够力，一定要用赤豆当归散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。记得我的话。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"慢性盲肠炎会痛，隐隐作痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你摸都可以摸到。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"急性盲肠炎，痛得很厉害"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170426-73nluof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170426-73nluof","updated":"20240422170426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个薏苡附子败酱散还有其他的功能。妇人呢，同样这个处方，肚脐呢有脓跑出来。阴部的地方，男人的阴茎、女人的阴部地方也会有出脓的现象，也就是说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腹部呢有这个脓疡的时候，都可以使用到薏苡附子败酱散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为它又有个名称就也叫做排脓汤。那就像我刚刚讲的，很多妇女的子宫里内面呢，如果你生完小孩有残余的胎盘或者是一些残留的东西没有排干净，甚而至于如果像动手术像里面有一个纱布留在里面，造成里面化脓，里面一化脓的时候，肚脐就会出脓，一挤脓就出来，还有那个阴部、阴道都会排脓出来，这个时候呢，都可以用这个薏苡附子败酱散。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170426-l0lffjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170426-l0lffjy","updated":"20240422170426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男人也有他的精宫。精宫在小肠跟膀胱中间的一道隔膜的地方，并不是真有组织在那里，那是男人的精宫。那里面如果得到什么病啊，发炎化脓了，也是会阴部出脓。这也是薏苡附子败酱散症。所以这个排脓，当腹部化脓疡的时候，我们是会使用它的。"}]}]}